{"overview":"نا بونگ سون شاید یک آشپز کمکی ماهر باشد، اما اعتماد به‌نفس کافی برای درخشش حرفه‌ای و اجتماعی ندارد. علاوه بر توانایی‌های آشپزی‌اش، او توانایی عجیبی در ارتباط با ارواح دارد. روزی حس‌های عرفانی‌اش وقتی روح فریبنده شین سون اِی او را تسخیر می‌کند، از کنترل خارج می‌شود. با شخصیتی جدید و آتشین، بونگ سون سرنوشت‌ساز می‌شود و حتی توجه کانگ سون وو، سرآشپز مشهور شهر و عشق مخفی بونگ سون را جلب می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Na Bong Sun may be a skilled sous chef, but she lacks the self-esteem to shine professionally and socially. Beyond her cooking talents, however, is an uncanny ability to communicate with ghosts. One day, her mystic senses go out of control when the seductive ghost of Shin Soon Ae possesses her. Imbued with a fiery new \"personality,\" Bong Sun starts turning heads, including that of Kang Sun Woo, the hottest chef in town and Bong Sun's secret crush!","tagline_en":"","runtime":64,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":16,"y":2015,"poster":"/vR4dRbemOYcft9gcSUUFG4UcJqT.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["유제원"],"crew_en":["Yoo Je-won"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"پارک بو یونگ","role":"Na Bong-sun","photo":"/x1LNh8i8XmO3oqNYzRslzYj1VoZ.jpg","en":"Park Bo-young"},{"name":"조정석","role":"Kang Sun-woo","photo":"/pVZHsNj31fNMyWixqg26TA9HjU1.jpg","en":"Cho Jung-seok"},{"name":"임주환","role":"Choi Sung-jae","photo":"/5aMAmPrQUGE5HaWrFsR3AXaFGL5.jpg","en":"Lim Ju-hwan"},{"name":"김슬기","role":"Shin Soon-ae","photo":"/u86TkLLd1PLxAvCgSQvr89tWDWP.jpg","en":"Kim Seul-gi"},{"name":"곽시양","role":"Seo Joon","photo":"/8fHGivHyjPxWjLFNlFratxey0To.jpg","en":"Kwak Si-yang"},{"name":"박정아","role":"Lee So-hyung","photo":"/g9yiwU44KeDBOwH2J1RhLPG91o8.jpg","en":"Park Jung-ah"},{"name":"이학주","role":"Shin Kyung-mo","photo":"/9PuGmzY1nm8uYYiOanEKJHEcdbZ.jpg","en":"Lee Hak-ju"},{"name":"강기영","role":"Heo Min-soo","photo":"/bZKB6fXWS7mBWoOBsXlLx0P36hJ.jpg","en":"Kang Ki-young"},{"name":"최민철","role":"Jo Dong-chul","photo":"/y6lon0ICFD8LUv6vDyHosFH2FzH.jpg","en"